~ wake_call
Kira: Coren.... Coren?
=> END

~ wake
Kira: Another nightmare... they're getting worse.
Kira: You're in no shape to go out. Lie back down and rest first.
=> END

~ next
if Story.is_set("inn_done")
	Kira: There you are! Looking like yourself again.
	Kira: Minerva came by earlier, I told her you would stop by, she's just next door so don't keep her waiting.
elif not Story.is_set("inn_used_vitality")
	Kira: Please Rest in the bed.
elif not Story.is_set("inn_used_intelligence")
	Kira: Sit in the chair for a moment, meditate and clear your mind.
elif not Story.is_set("inn_used_strength")
	Kira: Use the toilet, trust me. 
elif not Story.is_set("inn_used_charisma")
	Kira: Cleanse yourself in the bath, your already in there!
elif not Story.is_set("inn_used_dexterity")
	Kira: Warm yourself by the fire, the kids left food on the table for you!
=> END

~ inn_blocked
% Kira: Where do you think you're going? You can barely stand.
% Kira: No not yet, Coren. Take care of yourself first.
% Kira: Your a grown man I shouldn't have to tell you more than once!
=> END